	/// Master dimension containing all properties managed by Emerge Aotearoa's housing services. Includes transitional housing, community housing, and supported accommodation. Each record represents a unique property with its current state (filtered to DWHIsCurrent = 1). Contains property details, ownership, location, rental information, and service assignments.
